                   e i        edit todo                                                             |
                   d          delete todo          Editing                                          |
                   space      toggle done                                                           |
                   J K        reorder todo         enter      confirm                               |
                   v          visual mode          esc        cancel                                |
                   /          search               ← →        move caret                            |
                   u ctrl+r   undo / redo          home end   start/end of line                     |
                   h ←        focus sidebar        ctrl+w     delete word back                      |
