                   Visual                          delete     delete at caret                       |
                                                   paste      inserted as text                      |
                   j k ↓ ↑    extend selection                                                      |
                   J K        reorder selected     Search                                           |
                   d          delete selected                                                       |
                   space      toggle selected      type       filter todos                          |
